  "description": "XUQKIG crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C178 H162 Gd14 N8 O82. From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Gd3 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd4 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Gd5 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Gd6 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Gd7 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd8 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Gd9 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Gd10 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd11 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Gd12 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Gd13 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Gd14 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 14 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.648-3.762 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 89.63-105.98°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C178H162N8Gd14O82. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 8 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
